---
title: Oatmeal Cookies
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Cookies
cook time: 15-18 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@raisins{0.5%cup}
@sugar{1%cup}
@eggs{2}
@shortening{0.75%cup}
@oatmeal{2%cups}
@flour{2%cups}
@raisin water{7%Tbsp}
@cinnamon{1%tsp}
@baking powder{1%tsp}
@baking soda{1%tsp}

Cook 1/2 c raisins for about 10 minutes in water. Mix sugar, shortening and eggs. Add raisin water and raisins. Mix in flour mixture and oatmeal. Drop onto greased cookie sheet and bake at 350 degrees for about 15-18 minutes.
